fixups        set      classic
minos         at-most  10.9
load-command  delete   uuid
load-command  delete   codesig
dylib         replace  /usr/lib/libSystem.B.dylib   /usr/local/mavergreen/@RUNTIME@/lib/libSystemWrapper.dylib
dylib         replace  /usr/lib/libicucore.A.dylib  /usr/local/mavergreen/@RUNTIME@/lib/libicucoreWrapper.dylib
dylib         replace  /usr/lib/libc++.1.dylib      /usr/local/mavergreen/@RUNTIME@/lib/libc++.1.dylib
